{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Infinity: HexaDome Tactics - a hybrid of deep turn-based tactics and dynamic PvP combat, based on the renowned Infinity universe and the Aristeia! tabletop strategy game. Master a squad of elite champions and claim glory in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/859c261bc0e5cf87cf93840703b128ca.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/859c261bc0e5cf87cf93840703b128ca.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/859c261bc0e5cf87cf93840703b128ca.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A LEGACY OF GLORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital battlefield is born from the renowned Aristeia! tabletop strategy game. Experience the core competitive action, champion synergy, and dynamic objective control that made the original a fan favorite, now translated into a tactical 1v1 PvP experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/85b8385d3c97f9c5471a4be273159b1f.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/85b8385d3c97f9c5471a4be273159b1f.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/85b8385d3c97f9c5471a4be273159b1f.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMMAND THE ELITE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From animal-human hybrids to synthetic replicas of ancient samurai, only the best compete in the HexaDome. Master the synergy of diverse classes and combine their unique abilities to dominate any matchup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1c228b7f983ae98ab401aaaf42ca0761.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1c228b7f983ae98ab401aaaf42ca0761.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1c228b7f983ae98ab401aaaf42ca0761.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TACTICAL MASTERY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raw power means nothing without strategy. Make sure to utilize the arena to its fullest with a dynamic cover system, various POIs, and a goal post that is constantly moving around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/d5d59de5e0b0f61283599b1d8ce57d4c.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/d5d59de5e0b0f61283599b1d8ce57d4c.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/d5d59de5e0b0f61283599b1d8ce57d4c.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVERY ACTION COUNTS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike now or save your strength for a devastating ultimate? Smart resource management and careful planning are the keys to turning the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e778472fd4d8e3f26302ac5768b23a8a.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e778472fd4d8e3f26302ac5768b23a8a.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e778472fd4d8e3f26302ac5768b23a8a.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPE UP THE CROWD </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena demands a show! Infinity: HexaDome Tactics thrives on spectacle, so drive your fans wild with thrilling combat and your own personal flair as you compete for galaxy-wide fame and the support of our discerning and stylish sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e510a41bf50357249396792d35a28e8e.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e510a41bf50357249396792d35a28e8e.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e510a41bf50357249396792d35a28e8e.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1498550?t=1765961064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/38589125347f4da36e2d8988e4a2174f2402f1fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765961064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/556a9803da7f1e2843a92c5ccf45010ad097a296/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765961064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/556a9803da7f1e2843a92c5ccf45010ad097a296/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765961064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3423710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Infinity: HexaDome Tactics - a hybrid of deep turn-based tactics and dynamic PvP combat, based on the renowned Infinity universe and the Aristeia! tabletop strategy game. Master a squad of elite champions and claim glory in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/859c261bc0e5cf87cf93840703b128ca.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/859c261bc0e5cf87cf93840703b128ca.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/859c261bc0e5cf87cf93840703b128ca.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A LEGACY OF GLORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This digital battlefield is born from the renowned Aristeia! tabletop strategy game. Experience the core competitive action, champion synergy, and dynamic objective control that made the original a fan favorite, now translated into a tactical 1v1 PvP experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/85b8385d3c97f9c5471a4be273159b1f.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/85b8385d3c97f9c5471a4be273159b1f.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/85b8385d3c97f9c5471a4be273159b1f.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMMAND THE ELITE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From animal-human hybrids to synthetic replicas of ancient samurai, only the best compete in the HexaDome. Master the synergy of diverse classes and combine their unique abilities to dominate any matchup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1c228b7f983ae98ab401aaaf42ca0761.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1c228b7f983ae98ab401aaaf42ca0761.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/1c228b7f983ae98ab401aaaf42ca0761.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TACTICAL MASTERY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raw power means nothing without strategy. Make sure to utilize the arena to its fullest with a dynamic cover system, various POIs, and a goal post that is constantly moving around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/d5d59de5e0b0f61283599b1d8ce57d4c.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/d5d59de5e0b0f61283599b1d8ce57d4c.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/d5d59de5e0b0f61283599b1d8ce57d4c.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVERY ACTION COUNTS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike now or save your strength for a devastating ultimate? Smart resource management and careful planning are the keys to turning the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e778472fd4d8e3f26302ac5768b23a8a.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e778472fd4d8e3f26302ac5768b23a8a.webm?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e778472fd4d8e3f26302ac5768b23a8a.mp4?t=1765961064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPE UP THE CROWD </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena demands a show! Infinity: HexaDome Tactics thrives on spectacle, so drive your fans wild with thrilling combat and your own personal flair as you compete for galaxy-wide fame and the support of our discerning and stylish sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498550/extras/e510a41bf50357249396792d35a28e8e.poster.avif?t=1765961064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as